# UI-G-067: feedback add with a numeric third argument, an unknown style and a style long name.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load input/c
box 0 0 4 4
feedback add x 5 1 2
feedback count
feedback add x bogus
feedback count
feedback add x solid_highlights
feedback count
feedback bogus
feedback
